e\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><polyline points=\"282.00,172.50 288.00,175.00 282.00,177.50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><polyline points=\"285.00,185.00 288.00,180.00 291.00,185.00\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><polyline points=\"285.00,235.00 288.00,240.00 291.00,235.00\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><text x=\"285.00\" y=\"135.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">?</text><text x=\"240.00\" y=\"200.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">1.5 m</text><text x=\"186.00\" y=\"160.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">24 m</text><text x=\"138.00\" y=\"100.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">25 m</text></svg></span></div>\tA quale altezza vola l'aquilone (in \\(m\\)) ?\t<div class=\"oef-enterreply\">Inserire la risposta:</div><div class=\"oefnoembed\"><div class=\"oef-noembed-ligne\"><span class=\"oef-noembed-nom\"><label for=\"reply1\">L'altezza</label> = </span><span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1\" data-size=\"20\"></span></div></div>",
